                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Last pitch before the gate, and I stand it so nobody reaches Ryujin unblooded. I have watched this ledge for thirty years - I saw you three switchbacks down. Prove the climb was earned."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The others up the road were the warm-up. I am the wall. Beat me and the leader is just one more dragon."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "There is a face the Keep elders go quiet about. It is closer to yours than I would like. Show me it is not just a resemblance - show me on the field."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Korin Flameclaw",
                    Label: "default"
                }
